<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="callout fade-in">
            <h3>When a portal outgrows Power Pages</h3>
            <p>Power Pages is a sensible choice for a straightforward portal. Once a portal carries this much custom behaviour, a conventional .NET application over the same Dataverse data is easier to test, version and change with confidence.</p>
            <p>Dynamics stays exactly where it is. Only the front end changes.</p>
